><tbody><tr><td>Gutachten</td><td><code>report</code></td></tr><tr><td>Repa=
raturbest=C3=A4tigung</td><td><code>repair_confirmation</code></td></tr><tr=
><td>Manuelle Kalkulation</td><td><code>manual_calculation</code></td></tr>=
<tr><td>Rechnung</td><td><code>invoice</code></td></tr><tr><td>Minderwertpr=
